    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>travis, the frog is a lightning-fast 2D speedrunning game where you play as a frog on a skateboard, armed with a pistol.</i>\u00a0<i>Race through beautiful pixelated levels as fast as you possibly can, and help travis regain his humanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/7ff2edc6bf1053544b21d25a18a4b89c.poster.avif?t=1754588651\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/7ff2edc6bf1053544b21d25a18a4b89c.webm?t=1754588651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/7ff2edc6bf1053544b21d25a18a4b89c.mp4?t=1754588651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 64 levels \ud83d\udef9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>spanned across 8 vibrant biomes with unique mechanics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd47 leaderboards</strong>\u00a0\ud83d\udcc8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>race against the world through each concise yet detailed course</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 a banger soundtrack \ud83c\udfb8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>an upbeat math-rock/midwest-emo inspired soundtrack with a retro flare inspired by bands like marietta, tiny moving parts, and modern baseball</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 a frog on a skateboard with a gun \ud83d\udd2b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>what else needs to be said</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/22f8c83610601b82053b9ee6ff032f4a.poster.avif?t=1754588651\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/22f8c83610601b82053b9ee6ff032f4a.webm?t=1754588651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/22f8c83610601b82053b9ee6ff032f4a.mp4?t=1754588651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>travis, the frog is a lightning-fast 2D speedrunning game where you play as a frog on a skateboard, armed with a pistol.</i>\u00a0<i>Race through beautiful pixelated levels as fast as you possibly can, and help travis regain his humanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/7ff2edc6bf1053544b21d25a18a4b89c.poster.avif?t=1754588651\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/7ff2edc6bf1053544b21d25a18a4b89c.webm?t=1754588651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511950/extras/7ff2edc6bf1053544b21d25a18a4b89c.mp4?t=1754588651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 64 levels \ud83d\udef9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>spanned across 8 vibrant biomes with unique mechanics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd47 leaderboards</strong>\u00a0\ud83d\udcc8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>race against the world through each concise yet detailed course</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 a banger soundtrack \ud83c\udfb8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>an upbeat math-rock/midwest-emo inspired soundtrack with a retro flare inspired by bands like marietta, tiny moving parts, and modern baseball</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 a frog on a skateboard with a gun \ud83d\udd2b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>what else needs to be said</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"